{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4034015","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4034015-handbook-monster-4034015-0","text":"伴随黑潮而来、狩猎泰坦火种的无名剑士，面具下石像般的面容与救世主无异，几近崩毁，仿佛将死的薪柴。\n空洞的回响自火焰中来：一切皆为徒劳。","speaker":""}]}
